    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "maybe. but it feels more like the silence is just constant. like, i keep thinking about how most of the greatest art comes from people who were completely broken. like there's something about reaching the absolute end, the point where you can't go any further, that actually makes the art \"real.\" it makes me wonder if my work will only ever be honest if i actually touch that edge.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
